WEBVTT

00:00:09.242 --> 00:00:13.008
The construction of the tunnel
is finished after everyone's hard work.

00:00:15.281 --> 00:00:22.581
Candy has completed her mission,
and is going back to St-Joanna Hospital.

00:00:32.298 --> 00:00:36.894
Episode 109
The tears of the little cowboy

00:00:51.251 --> 00:00:54.880
You can't follow me out again
after we get back to Chicago, alright?

00:00:58.258 --> 00:01:00.185
Don't be like this.

00:01:00.335 --> 00:01:04.959
Kurin, you'll stay at Pony's Home,
and I will come back often.

00:01:08.301 --> 00:01:11.896
We're almost there, let's go!

00:01:24.284 --> 00:01:27.947
Kurin, it's Pony's Home!

00:01:28.221 --> 00:01:29.916
And father tree!

00:01:33.293 --> 00:01:35.921
Kurin, let's go!

00:01:41.234 --> 00:01:42.963
Come!

00:01:43.236 --> 00:01:45.398
Come! Come!

00:01:46.239 --> 00:01:49.969
Be good, you should eat more!

00:01:50.310 --> 00:01:54.940
Sister Pony!
Sister Pony!

00:01:58.218 --> 00:02:00.948
Candy!

00:02:01.254 --> 00:02:02.949
Candy!

00:02:07.260 --> 00:02:10.221
Where is Sister Pony going to?

00:02:10.371 --> 00:02:12.223
Sister Pony!

00:02:12.373 --> 00:02:13.993
Candy!

00:02:14.234 --> 00:02:15.226
Sister Pony!

00:02:15.376 --> 00:02:17.895
Sister Lane!

00:02:25.278 --> 00:02:26.939
Candy!

00:02:27.280 --> 00:02:29.947
Sister Pony!

00:02:32.520 --> 00:02:36.882
- Sister Pony!
- Candy!

00:02:42.228 --> 00:02:45.223
Sister Pony, I am back at last!
I am back from Graytown!

00:02:45.373 --> 00:02:48.159
Did you finish your duty?

00:02:48.309 --> 00:02:49.227
Yes!

00:02:49.377 --> 00:02:52.931
It's so good to see you!

00:02:55.308 --> 00:03:00.205
I heard it's terrible there.
I was so worried about you!

00:03:00.355 --> 00:03:02.173
Welcome home, Candy!

00:03:02.323 --> 00:03:03.208
Sister Lane, I am home!

00:03:03.358 --> 00:03:06.946
Sister Pony,
you brought the ducks with you!

00:03:12.258 --> 00:03:14.920
Same as Sister Lane!

00:03:22.302 --> 00:03:24.964
- Candy, come on in!
- Yes!

00:03:36.282 --> 00:03:38.209
Where are the children?

00:03:38.359 --> 00:03:40.946
Jimmy took them out.

00:03:41.221 --> 00:03:42.180
Please come in!

00:03:42.330 --> 00:03:44.215
He takes them out very often.

00:03:44.365 --> 00:03:47.919
I hope it's for good
and normal games...

00:03:48.294 --> 00:03:50.263
Open fire!

00:03:55.268 --> 00:03:57.896
Attack!

00:04:08.248 --> 00:04:12.177
Look, Candy,
the children drew them!

00:04:12.327 --> 00:04:14.179
They are very good!

00:04:14.329 --> 00:04:18.291
I asked them to draw
what they want to be in the future.

00:04:20.260 --> 00:04:22.295
Ah, here is a nurse!

00:04:25.298 --> 00:04:28.961
That must be because of Candy!

00:04:33.273 --> 00:04:36.902
That must be because of Sister Pony.

00:04:37.243 --> 00:04:38.938
They already know their dreams.

00:04:39.245 --> 00:04:42.908
It took me a long time
to find out what I really wanted to be.

00:04:43.283 --> 00:04:48.880
It's too early for them
to make sure their ways.

00:04:49.289 --> 00:04:52.952
Looks like someone's coming!

00:04:53.293 --> 00:04:55.955
It's Mr. Cartwright!

00:04:56.229 --> 00:04:57.222
What is he visiting for?

00:04:57.372 --> 00:04:59.525
Mr. Cartwright!

00:05:04.270 --> 00:05:05.965
Mr. Cartwright!

00:05:06.272 --> 00:05:08.233
Candy!

00:05:08.383 --> 00:05:10.970
Candy, is that really you?

00:05:11.244 --> 00:05:12.203
Long time no see!

00:05:12.353 --> 00:05:13.939
I missed you so much!

00:05:15.248 --> 00:05:17.944
You've grown up!
Now you're a beautiful lady!

00:05:18.217 --> 00:05:19.210
You seem healthy too.

00:05:19.360 --> 00:05:23.214
My body condition is good but...

00:05:23.364 --> 00:05:25.216
What happened?

00:05:25.366 --> 00:05:27.987
Excuse me...

00:05:31.294 --> 00:05:33.960
What's wrong, Mr. Cartwright?

00:05:34.267 --> 00:05:36.963
I want to discuss about Jimmy.

00:05:37.236 --> 00:05:39.163
About Jimmy?

00:05:39.313 --> 00:05:42.901
Candy, you can come to hear, too.

00:05:45.278 --> 00:05:48.907
There's a problem.

00:05:51.250 --> 00:05:54.947
Jimmy insists
on becoming a soldier lately.

00:05:55.254 --> 00:05:56.214
A soldier?

00:05:56.364 --> 00:05:58.182
But why?

00:05:58.332 --> 00:06:02.887
There are often soldiers practicing
around here.

00:06:18.277 --> 00:06:21.205
Father, I want to be a soldier too!

00:06:21.355 --> 00:06:23.942
Jimmy!

00:06:24.283 --> 00:06:28.179
Since then, he wants
to become a soldier.

00:06:28.329 --> 00:06:30.214
He abandoned his daily job
at the farm.

00:06:30.364 --> 00:06:34.585
Every day he plays war games
with the other kids.

00:06:35.294 --> 00:06:39.890
No wonder he takes the kids out so often.

00:06:41.234 --> 00:06:46.934
Is Jimmy having the same aspiration
as Stear to go the European battlefield?

00:06:48.307 --> 00:06:51.936
I am not against going to the army.

00:06:52.278 --> 00:06:55.173
But what about my farm?

00:06:55.323 --> 00:06:58.176
Jimmy is the Cartwrights' heir.

00:06:58.326 --> 00:07:01.245
Jimmy knows this.

00:07:02.095 --> 00:07:04.983
I can understand, Mr. Cartwright.

00:07:05.224 --> 00:07:08.219
We must talk to Jimmy.

00:07:08.369 --> 00:07:12.223
Sister Pony, Sister Lane,
let me do it.

00:07:12.373 --> 00:07:14.225
But...

00:07:14.375 --> 00:07:19.197
It might be better
if Candy speaks to him.

00:07:19.347 --> 00:07:23.234
We know that Jimmy listens
to what Candy says.

00:07:25.384 --> 00:07:27.205
Candy, I trust in you!

00:07:27.355 --> 00:07:28.701
Yes, Mr. Cartwright!

00:07:29.248 --> 00:07:31.610
Attack!

00:07:41.294 --> 00:07:43.956
Stop, everyone!

00:07:48.234 --> 00:07:49.963
That's the end of today's game.

00:07:54.273 --> 00:07:56.970
I will now show you some nice stuff!

00:07:59.245 --> 00:08:01.172
A real rifle!

00:08:01.322 --> 00:08:04.944
Yes, it is used in the battle!

00:08:06.285 --> 00:08:08.947
I also have the bullets!

00:08:14.260 --> 00:08:17.255
- Look, I'll shoot now!
- Can you?

00:08:17.405 --> 00:08:19.257
Don't look down upon me.

00:08:19.407 --> 00:08:21.960
Come on, look at the tree!

00:08:41.285 --> 00:08:42.914
Everyone, go back to the house!

00:08:50.296 --> 00:08:51.957
Stay here, don't move!

00:08:52.231 --> 00:08:53.292
Jimmy!

00:08:55.301 --> 00:08:57.929
What is that noise?

00:09:07.280 --> 00:09:09.173
The cows are out of control!

00:09:09.323 --> 00:09:10.943
They're running towards here!

00:09:13.252 --> 00:09:14.981
The children!

00:09:15.254 --> 00:09:17.181
It's too dangerous outside!

00:09:17.331 --> 00:09:18.917
Children!

00:09:19.225 --> 00:09:21.219
Sister Pony!

00:09:21.369 --> 00:09:23.154
Candy!

00:09:23.304 --> 00:09:24.924
You stay here!

00:09:25.264 --> 00:09:26.959
Where are the children?!

00:09:33.306 --> 00:09:34.967
Sister Pony!

00:09:35.241 --> 00:09:36.167
Candy!

00:09:36.317 --> 00:09:37.201
Go back to the house!

00:09:37.351 --> 00:09:38.202
The children...

00:09:38.352 --> 00:09:39.938
They will be alright.

00:09:43.280 --> 00:09:45.943
Watch out!
Lie with your face down!

00:10:00.299 --> 00:10:01.926
Mr. Cartwright...

00:10:03.302 --> 00:10:06.965
Stop! Stop!

00:10:16.248 --> 00:10:17.943
Mr. Cartwright!

00:10:26.292 --> 00:10:27.953
Mr. Cartwright!

00:10:55.254 --> 00:10:57.984
Mr. Cartwright!

00:11:13.305 --> 00:11:15.933
Oh my God!

00:11:16.275 --> 00:11:17.970
Mr. Cartwright!

00:11:21.280 --> 00:11:27.879
Father, I...

00:11:30.289 --> 00:11:31.215
Jimmy!

00:11:31.365 --> 00:11:33.918
Candy, go see Mr. Cartwright first.

00:11:34.260 --> 00:11:37.957
Father is dead because of me!

00:11:51.243 --> 00:11:52.938
Mr. Cartwright!

00:11:55.247 --> 00:11:58.175
He's still got a pulse!
Mr. Cartwright is still alive!

00:11:58.325 --> 00:11:59.945
He's still alive!

00:12:00.286 --> 00:12:02.880
Help him out!

00:12:13.299 --> 00:12:15.927
Candy, how is Mr. Cartwright?

00:12:16.302 --> 00:12:19.230
He's ok, he's just fainted!

00:12:19.380 --> 00:12:21.899
That's great!

00:12:22.241 --> 00:12:24.971
He fell right into a hole.

00:12:26.245 --> 00:12:28.172
Why is here a hole?

00:12:28.322 --> 00:12:30.076
Could it be...

00:12:47.233 --> 00:12:48.962
The trap dug by the kids.

00:12:49.268 --> 00:12:51.930
That hole was useful, after all!

00:12:56.308 --> 00:12:58.202
Are you awake?

00:12:58.352 --> 00:13:00.271
Thank God!

00:13:00.421 --> 00:13:02.940
Sister Pony! Sister Lane!

00:13:04.250 --> 00:13:07.913
Everybody's all right!
That's great!

00:13:08.220 --> 00:13:09.949
Candy!

00:13:10.222 --> 00:13:11.951
Well done, everyone!

00:13:13.292 --> 00:13:16.187
I will praise you today!

00:13:16.337 --> 00:13:17.923
That's right!

00:13:41.253 --> 00:13:44.181
I just got hurt a little bit.
Don't worry about me!

00:13:44.331 --> 00:13:46.986
Go to bring back the cows!

00:13:47.259 --> 00:13:48.219
Yes, sir.

00:13:48.369 --> 00:13:50.656
I will leave a horse here.

00:13:55.267 --> 00:13:56.227
Ok, that's alright.

00:13:56.377 --> 00:14:00.932
Thank you, Candy.
You're really good!

00:14:02.241 --> 00:14:03.234
Father is still alive!

00:14:03.384 --> 00:14:05.004
Father!

00:14:05.277 --> 00:14:07.204
Jimmy, what's wrong with him?

00:14:07.354 --> 00:14:10.207
After he left, there's no sight of him.

00:14:10.357 --> 00:14:14.946
He ran away
because of his bad behaviour.

00:14:15.221 --> 00:14:16.213
He's a useless thing!

00:14:16.363 --> 00:14:19.917
How can he be a soldier like that?

00:14:20.259 --> 00:14:25.222
Yes, I want to be a soldier,
I can't run away!

00:14:25.372 --> 00:14:30.929
Ok, I'll get the cows back
to save my reputation!

00:14:35.241 --> 00:14:37.903
Jimmy! Wait, Jimmy!

00:14:38.244 --> 00:14:41.205
No, he wants to find the cows!
Jimmy can't do that!

00:14:41.355 --> 00:14:43.942
Mr. Cartwright, I want to borrow
your horse, please!

00:14:51.223 --> 00:14:52.952
Jimmy! Wait!

00:14:55.261 --> 00:14:56.922
He's running towards the forest!

00:15:09.241 --> 00:15:11.937
Ok, I will catch this cow
to save my reputation!

00:15:30.329 --> 00:15:32.889
There you go!

00:15:54.286 --> 00:15:55.212
Jimmy!

00:15:56.362 --> 00:15:58.882
Jimmy, let go of the rope!

00:16:03.228 --> 00:16:04.957
I won't!

00:16:05.230 --> 00:16:06.925
Jimmy!

00:16:34.293 --> 00:16:35.219
Jimmy!

00:16:35.369 --> 00:16:37.221
Jimmy, are you alright?

00:16:37.371 --> 00:16:41.191
Boss, why do you interfere
with my business?

00:16:41.341 --> 00:16:43.227
You mean it's none of my business?

00:16:43.377 --> 00:16:44.963
Exactly!

00:16:47.237 --> 00:16:49.936
I did it for my reputation!

00:16:50.242 --> 00:16:51.201
What are you talking about?

00:16:51.351 --> 00:16:53.203
Why do you still speak like a soldier!

00:16:53.353 --> 00:16:56.273
I am going to become one!

00:16:56.423 --> 00:17:00.210
Jimmy, you made such a big trouble.
You still want to become a soldier?

00:17:00.360 --> 00:17:02.212
I've made up my mind!

00:17:02.362 --> 00:17:06.216
I want to be a soldier,
to fight in the battle!

00:17:06.366 --> 00:17:08.953
The war does need soldiers.

00:17:09.228 --> 00:17:11.958
But, we also need cowboys.

00:17:12.297 --> 00:17:16.927
And war is not as easy
as you think, Jimmy.

00:17:19.271 --> 00:17:22.968
So Candy, you are saying
that you know how war is?

00:17:23.275 --> 00:17:24.970
You know what a battle is like?

00:17:27.279 --> 00:17:29.907
Yes, I do.

00:17:30.249 --> 00:17:34.879
In the hospital, I've seen so many
victims and patients from the war.

00:17:35.254 --> 00:17:38.917
Thousands of people sacrificed
themselves on the front line.

00:17:39.258 --> 00:17:43.922
There are also many nurses fulfilling
their mission in the battlefield.

00:17:44.263 --> 00:17:48.927
War is very terrible
and sorrowful too.

00:17:49.234 --> 00:17:51.228
Only cowards would think that!

00:17:53.878 --> 00:17:57.702
I am not afraid of it at all!
Look how I deal with the enemy!

00:18:06.218 --> 00:18:07.947
Jimmy, you idiot!

00:18:09.221 --> 00:18:12.918
How dare you hit me!
You are not my boss anymore!

00:18:13.225 --> 00:18:14.920
Jimmy!

00:18:15.260 --> 00:18:17.221
What else do you want to say?

00:18:17.371 --> 00:18:21.158
I didn't want to show you at first.
But now, I want to show you.

00:18:21.308 --> 00:18:24.896
Follow me.

00:18:35.280 --> 00:18:38.875
Why did this happen?!

00:18:40.252 --> 00:18:43.247
Jimmy, don't turn your head away. Look!

00:18:43.397 --> 00:18:46.216
Look at this sad scene.

00:18:46.366 --> 00:18:49.886
In the battlefield, those are
human bodies scattered around.

00:18:52.297 --> 00:18:55.225
Many have lost their beloved ones.

00:18:55.375 --> 00:18:58.929
There are always people
sacrificing themselves every day.

00:19:02.241 --> 00:19:03.970
That's war!

00:19:08.247 --> 00:19:13.879
Those cows, you brought them up,
didn't you, Jimmy?

00:19:21.368 --> 00:19:26.925
Jimmy, that's ok if you can
understand it. Jimmy...

00:19:36.275 --> 00:19:40.939
I am sorry, father.

00:19:41.246 --> 00:19:44.643
I want to be a great cowboy.
I will take over the farm!

00:19:47.850 --> 00:19:49.880
Jimmy!

00:19:56.261 --> 00:20:00.660
Mr. Cartwright, if he did anything
wrong, please fix him!

00:20:01.233 --> 00:20:04.896
Sure! I won't spoil my kid!

00:20:05.237 --> 00:20:06.230
Father!

00:20:06.380 --> 00:20:09.900
Father and son...

00:20:10.242 --> 00:20:12.938
Yes.

00:20:13.278 --> 00:20:16.206
The general of the enemy is crying!

00:20:16.356 --> 00:20:19.876
Crying! Strange...

00:20:21.253 --> 00:20:24.916
What, how dare you look down upon me!
Wait!

00:20:54.253 --> 00:20:57.882
Pony's Home, Pony's Hill...

00:20:58.223 --> 00:21:01.654
I am now leaving, goodbye!

00:21:05.297 --> 00:21:12.965
Candy returns to Chicago, and there's
a gentle breeze filling up her heart.

00:21:15.000 --> 00:21:18.000
video file & English subtitles: Safex
fixed by fofiko1 and Rémi
